# Supabase Configuration
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace all placeholder values with your actual API keys
# 3. Never commit the .env file to version control
# 4. Supabase keys can be found in: Project Settings > API
#
# Note: Google Gemini API key is now configured in Supabase Edge Functions
# See SUPABASE_EDGE_FUNCTIONS.md for setup instructions
